467,"page_no":195,"line_no":83467,"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਨ ਪੁਰਖ ਧਯਾਵਹੀਂ ॥","translit_en":"nirabaan purakh dhayaavahee(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਨਿਰਬਾਨ ਪੁਰਖ ਨੂੰ ਧਿਆਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":83468,"page_no":195,"line_no":83468,"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਮਾਨ ਅੰਤਿ ਪਾਵਹੀਂ ॥੬॥","translit_en":"bimaan a(n)t paavahee(n) ||6||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"They meditated on the Detached Supreme Purusha and ultimately they acquired the air-vehicles for transportation to heaven.6."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਅੰਤ ਵੇਲੇ (ਦੇਵ ਪਦਵੀ ਪਾਣ ਲਈ) ਵਿਮਾਨਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਬੈਠਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੬॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":7883,"next":7885}}